    "detailed_description": "Don\u2019t stand still. Don\u2019t turn back. And don\u2019t trust your eyes. Step into Looking Glass, a PC horror VR game set in the darkness of a hedge labyrinth. Peer through the blackness\u2014and keep tabs on the strange figures surrounding you\u2014using nothing but a hand mirror.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere\u2019s no map. No walkthrough. And no two mazes are the same. Looking Glass takes cues from the golden era of mouse-and-keyboard horror\u2014but it's built for virtual reality. Discover strange landmarks, vaulted passages, and a landscape both suspenseful and serene. Grab your Index, Rift, or Vive and try one of the best VR horror games on Steam.",
